---
description: Core Harness Engineering rules for this repo
---

## Core Principles
- Prefer **small cohesive changes** over broad refactors.
- Keep **behavior explicit** (no silent failures).
- Always include **verification evidence** (minimum `pytest`).

## Boundaries (source of truth)
- `app/main.py`: transport/routing only
- `app/db.py` (+ related modules): schema + queries
- `app/templates/`: view structure (minimal logic)
- `app/static/js/`: shared UI primitives + page logic

## Delivery
- Summarize **what/why** and include **how validated**.
- Avoid unrelated file churn.

